t_axis_deg": null, "split_ratio": null, "cutoff_nm": null, "reflect": null, "aom_frequency_mhz": null, "aom_efficiency": null, "aom_order": null, "acoustic_velocity_m_s": null, "fiber_mfd_um": null, "transmission": null, "saturation_power_mw": null, "small_signal_gain_db": null, "nl_efficiency_per_w": null}], "targets": [{"element_id": "D3", "kind": "min_power_mw", "value": 4.0}, {"element_id": "FC_out1", "kind": "min_power_mw", "value": 4.0}, {"element_id": "D4", "kind": "min_power_mw", "value": 5.0}, {"element_id": "FC_out2", "kind": "min_power_mw", "value": 5.0}, {"element_id": "D1", "kind": "min_power_mw", "value": 4.0}, {"element_id": "D2", "kind": "min_power_mw", "value": 4.0}], "notes": "Three-module setup: (1) Target photon preparation: 1550 nm pulsed laser -> SHG -> 775 nm pump split at HWP1+PBS1; transmitted arm goes through 4-mirror motion-stage delay (M1-M4) and PPLN/W1 waveguide, then SPF1 splits signal/idler to VHG1->FC_out1 and VHG2->D3. (2) Probe photon preparation: reflected 775 nm pump from PBS1 turns at M6 and combines at dichroic DM with 1535 nm CW seed (from FC_in2 via M5), passes through PPLN/W2 and splits at SPF2 to VHG3->FC_out2 and VHG4->D4. (3) HOM-QST: fibers from FC_out1 and FC_out2 feed FC_hom1 and FC_hom2, each prepared by PBS+HWP+QWP and directed at +/-45 deg by M7, M8 into the 50:50 beamsplitter HBS, then leveled by M9, M10 into fiber-coupled detectors D1, D2."}, "report": {"passed": false, "score": 18.224886725634462, "checks": [{"id": "clipping", "severity": "error", "message": "FC_out1: 16.3% clipped (beam radius 3.15 mm, offset 0.00 mm)", "element_id": "FC_out1", "segment_id": "s15", "value": 0.16264396396858494, "limit": 0.1}, {"id": "clipping", "severity": "warning", "message": "FC_out2: 3.5% clipped (beam radius 2.32 mm, offset 0.00 mm)", "element_id": "FC_out2", "segment_id": "s24", "value": 0.034873448185123945, "limit": 0.01}, {"id": "no_light", "severity": "info", "message": "BD_pbs2 receives no light", "element_id": "BD_pb